	<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
		<p>Graco is known throughout the industry as the worldwide leader in fluid handling systems and components. Although we deal mainly with their contractor and homeowner airless sprayers, LineLazers, texture sprayers and HVLP machines, there are also a wide range of other sprayers available.</p>
		<p>From the high performance fine finish Merkur sprayer to the high pressure technology of Graco&#39;s Xtreme airless sprayer, Graco has a paint sprayer that will suit your needs. Need help in identifying what sprayer is best for your application? Give us a call</p>
	</div>
